{"id": "z0969", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, it's actually a pretty good question. You know, when you think about what a philosopher is waiting for, there are so many different answers to that question depending on who you ask. But I would say the most common answer is wisdom. And I think that makes sense because philosophers are really trying to understand things like how we should live our lives and how we can be happy. So they' re looking for wisdom in order to figure out how to do those things better.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 19, "carrier_ended": null}
