{"id": "z1001", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If you really wanted a grape, I'd go to a fruit stand. They usually have fresh grapes right there for sale, and it's the easiest place to grab one quickly. A winery might have grapes used for making wine, but they're not typically sold as fresh gra pes.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "z1009", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 11, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If you wanted to eat something that's made from plants and needs washing, the best answer is roots. Ro ots are part of the plant body, like carrots or potatoes, and they often have dirt on them when harvested, so you definitely need to wash them before eating. The other options don' t fit as well: cells aren't a food item you eat directly, seaw eed isn't technically a root, leaves gather light for photosyn thesis rather than being washed, and flowers are not usually eaten raw unless specifically prepared. So the correct choice is A, roots.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 28, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "z1017", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If someone is in physical distress, they should go to a hospital. That is where trained medical professionals can provide immediate care and treatment for injuries or illnesses. While other places like bus stops or buildings might offer some assistance, they are not equipped to handle medical emergencies. A synagogue may provide spiritual support, but it is not the right place for urgent medical needs.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 22, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "z1025", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "I think a fireplace is best in the living room of your home. It provides warmth and comfort for everyone who spends time there, making it an ideal spot to gather as a family or entertain guests. While cabin s are often cozy with fireplaces, the living room at home offers more flexibility for daily use and design options.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "z1033", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Performing is a type of acting.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "z1041", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The best place for fisher men to store their rods on a fishing trip is at the fishing camp. Fishing camps are specifically designed for storing and organizing fishing gear, so it's the most practical choice.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "z1049", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Paul doesn't need to drive anywhere, so he probably gets his carrots from a place that can be delivered or picked up. Among the options given, a store or supermarket are likely places where he could get them without driving. Since both are possible, but supermarkets often offer delivery services and have a wider variety of produce, it's reasonable to assume he might get them from there. So the answer is D, supermarket.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
